        >>> input = torch.randn(1, 3 * 2 * 2, 12)
        >>> output = fold(input)
        >>> output.size()
        torch.Size([1, 3, 4, 5])

    .. _link:
        https://github.com/vdumoulin/conv_arithmetic/blob/master/README.md

